%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bf2d7532251303545ab78ab68b00d5cf, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lobby_ElevatorRide
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sequenceId: Lobby_ElevatorRide
  notes: 'Elevator briefing before arrival on floor 17. Source: HEARTH_Full_Game_Script_Expanded_Native_English_Lobby_Mia_Commentary.md,
    Scene 1.2. Text is synchronized by Tools/Hearth/Dialogue/Sync All Dialogue From
    Final Script.'
  lines:
  - startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Inspector, a quick briefing before we reach seventeen. Procedure first,
      then tonight's route.
    holdSeconds: 6.0556602
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mia
    text: Go ahead.
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Each household is reviewed through its companion unit's inspection terminal.
      Once you badge in, you'll see why the household purchased the unit, how it's
      being used, and its current Household Emotional Stability Index.
    holdSeconds: 12
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: From there, you can enter the unit's point of view and replay recent significant
      events. Your review is based on that playback.
    holdSeconds: 9.451886
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: At the end, you'll choose a disposition. That determines how the unit is
      used in the household going forward and may affect the household's stability
      score.
    holdSeconds: 10.96132
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mia
    text: And you'll tell me which one you prefer.
    holdSeconds: 4.1688676
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: I'll recommend an option at every terminal. The recommendation comes directly
      from the inspection manual. Standard answers, Inspector. That's all I operate
      on.
    holdSeconds: 9.829245
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: For context, companion-unit adoption in this district is ninety-four point
      seven percent. According to this year's white paper, households with a unit
      average eight point four out of ten on the stability index. Households without
      one average five point nine.
    holdSeconds: 12
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: The index is public data. Employers, insurers, schools, and community boards
      have authorized access. A low score may be interpreted as a household spending
      too much time and energy on conflict, and it can affect hiring, premiums, and
      school placement.
    holdSeconds: 12
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: That does not determine your decisions tonight. It is context only.
    holdSeconds: 5.3009434
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mia
    text: Noted.
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: 'Tonight''s route: 17F-01, routine review. Daniel and Emily requested an
      upgrade to Night Companion Pro this morning. Review last night''s event before
      signing off. 17F-02, Ben and Claire. Ben force-shut their unit at 6:47 this
      evening. Full playback required. 17F-03 is flagged. I''ll brief you when we
      get there.'
    holdSeconds: 12
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mia
    text: A forced shutdown? That's unusual.
    holdSeconds: 3.0367923
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Seven cases company-wide this month.
    holdSeconds: 3.0367923
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: I'll guide you at each apartment. Have a good shift, Inspector.
    holdSeconds: 5.3009434
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
